msgid "Can't save face model"
msgstr "Ba za a iya ajiye samfurin fuska ba"

#: src/onboarding.py:568 src/onboarding.py:624
msgid "Scan second model"
msgstr "Duba samfurin na biyu"

#: src/onboarding.py:572
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "An kasa yin rikodin samfurin na biyu"

#: src/onboarding.py:572
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. Make sure your"
" face is well lit and centred, then try again -- or skip and add a mod"
"el later from Settings."
msgstr ""
"An ajiye samfurin ku na farko, don haka shiga fuska ya riga ya yi aiki"
". Tabbatar cewa fuskarka tana da haske sosai kuma tana tsakiya, sannan"
" a sake gwadawa -- ko tsallake kuma ƙara samfurin daga baya daga Saitu"
"na."

#: src/onboarding.py:607
msgid "Add a face model (required)"
msgstr "Ƙara samfurin fuska (da ake buƙata)"

#: src/onboarding.py:609
msgid ""
"Face login needs at least one face model, so this scan can't be skippe"
"d. Record it in the light you usually sit in. Lighting changes how you"
"r face looks to the camera, so consider adding a second model later fr"
"om Settings, recorded in different light (for example evening lamps in"
"stead of daylight)."
msgstr ""
"Shigar da fuska yana buƙatar aƙalla samfurin fuska ɗaya, don haka ba z"
"a a iya tsallake wannan sikanin ba. Yi rikodin shi a cikin hasken da k"
"uka saba zama a ciki. Haske yana canza yadda fuskarku ke kallon kyamar"
"a, don haka la'akari da ƙara samfuri na biyu daga baya daga Saituna, w"
"anda aka rubuta a cikin haske daban-daban (misali fitilu na yamma maim"
"akon hasken rana)."

#: src/onboarding.py:618
msgid "Add a second face model (recommended)"
msgstr "Ƙara samfurin fuska na biyu (an bada shawarar)"

#: src/onboarding.py:620
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved. Lighting changes how your face looks to the"
" camera: a model recorded in daylight can fail in the evening under la"
"mps (or the other way round), and Ubuntu Hello then times out instead "
"of unlocking. A second model recorded in different light keeps recogni"
"tion reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"An ajiye samfurin ku na farko. Haske yana canza yadda fuskarka ke kall"
"on kyamara: samfurin da aka yi rikodin a cikin hasken rana zai iya kas"
"awa da maraice a ƙarƙashin fitilu (ko kuma wata hanyar zagaye), kuma U"
"buntu Hello sannan lokuta ya fita maimakon buɗewa. Samfurin na biyu da"
" aka yi rikodin a cikin haske daban-daban yana kiyaye abin dogaro a ko"
"wane lokaci na rana."

#: src/onboarding.py:622
msgid ""
"Change the lighting first: switch the room light or desk lamp on or of"
"f, turn away from the window, or put on the glasses you sometimes wear"
". Then look straight into the camera and press Scan."
msgstr ""
"Canja hasken da farko: kunna ko kashe fitilar ɗakin ko tebur, kau da k"
"ai daga taga, ko sanya gilashin da kuke sawa a wasu lokuta. Sannan dub"
"a kai tsaye cikin kamara kuma danna Scan."

#: src/onboarding.py:660
msgid "Ubuntu Hello Setup"
msgstr "Ubuntu Hello Saita"

#: src/onboarding.py:673
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware a"
"nd tools..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello na iya buɗe {} ta atomatik ta amfani da tantancewar fuska"
" (wallet ɗin da aka gano: {}).\n\n<b>Matsalar TPM:</b> Ana duba kayan "
"aikin TPM da kayan aikin..."

#: src/onboarding.py:693
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. "
"Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello na iya buɗe {} ta atomatik ta amfani da tantancewar fuska"
" (wallet ɗin da aka gano: {}).\n\n<b>Matsalar TPM:</b> An gano kayan a"
"ikin TPM. Ana shigar da <i>tpm2-tools</i> kai tsaye..."

#: src/onboarding.py:705
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active"
". Your password will be securely sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello na iya buɗe {} ta atomatik ta amfani da tantancewar fuska"
" (wallet ɗin da aka gano: {}).\n\n<b>Matsalar TPM:</b> Hardware TPM 2."
"0 yana aiki. Za a rufe kalmar sirri ta amintaccen cikin TPM."

#: src/onboarding.py:707
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, "
"but automatic installation of <i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo"
" apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Falling back to software-based credent"
"ial caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello na iya buɗe {} ta atomatik ta amfani da tantancewar fuska"
" (wallet ɗin da aka gano: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Matsayi:</b> An gano kayan ai"
"kin TPM, amma shigarwa ta atomatik na <i>tpm2-tools</i> ya kasa. Gudu "
"<code>sudo dace shigar tpm2-tools</code>. Faɗuwa zuwa tushen caching n"
"a tushen software."

#: src/onboarding.py:709
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detecte"
"d. Using software-based credential caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello na iya buɗe {} ta atomatik ta amfani da tantancewar fuska"
" (wallet ɗin da aka gano: {}).\n\n<b>Matsalar TPM:</b> Ba a gano kayan"
" aikin TPM ba. Yin amfani da caching na tushen software (AES-256-GCM)."

